---
source: crates/dovetail-tui/tests/discoverability.rs
expression: "popup_text(&CONVERSATION, \"<leader>\")"
---
[Move] n    focus the inbox
[Move] ␣    find any task, agent or inbox item
[Views] z    focus mode: hide the side column
[Views] a    activity feed
[Views] m    message timeline
[Views] b    task board
[Views] g    worktrees
[Views] M    maps
[Views] R    list tasks that have research
[Views] ?    show or hide the side chats
[Views] r    reading mode: library, reader and Ask
[Agents] c    show the coordinator
[Agents] ⇥    back to the previous agent
[Agents] s…   +agents
[Tasks] t    capture a task
[Projects] p…   +projects
[Maps] v    MAP mode: the map full screen
